I was told that in the past, maybe 20 years ago, 30 years ago,

c0400
00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:40.940
there was no concept of kosher, black kosher.

c0401
00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:42.040
Absolutely correct.

c0402
00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:43.460
Absolutely correct.

