we want to have separate thing. So the teacher of my teacher, Bishak Abu'l-Afil, was one of the

c0422
00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:15.260
ones, he was in Tiberias at the time, he intervened on behalf of the Ashkenaz to get them, let them

c0423
00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:19.460
have a permit from the Turkish government probably because maybe had

c0424
00:22:19.460 --> 00:22:24.140
pulled with I don't know exactly the bureaucracy and they were able to get

c0425
00:22:24.140 --> 00:22:29.960
the permit so and therefore now they justify the shahita as being

c0426
00:22:29.960 --> 00:22:36.420
glad. Now in America when I came to America there was no such a concept of

c0427
00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:42.580
glatt kosher. There was none. Why? Because the Ashkenaz of the Ashkenaz

c0428
00:22:42.580 --> 00:22:48.740
they were in charge of sheikhah, they were not from the Hasidim, you see, and they were came from

c0429
