Vasha, from Minsk, or Pinsk, or one of the large cities, and those cities they had ration, they rationed

c0430
00:22:55.540 --> 00:23:02.420
the cows, and they would make shaitan, not according to, not glad. I ate from it. Why? Because the law is as

c0431
00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:08.900
simple as this. Yes, we say, we eat halak. That's the malan, says the tzatzik.

c0432
00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:10.420
Not one bu'a?

c0433
00:23:10.420 --> 00:23:18.900
Not one bu'a, if there's a bu'a, no, it is bu'a, one bu'a, no, even one bu'a they don't, they don't, they don't, they throw it.

c0434
00:23:18.900 --> 00:23:24.900
And I told you the reason why, because we used to be slaughtering the same slaughterhouse as the mas'in, why should we even,

c0435
00:23:24.900 --> 00:23:33.300
it's more waste time to be bodek this bu'a than to give it to the goy and you take another one and you shohed.

c0436
00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:40.300
was the problem. It's much easier. Alright. So by law, that was the custom. But here comes a point, a very important point.

c0437
00:23:40.300 --> 00:23:46.300
There was a question as to the Hidah. Haim David, the Sefer Zulay, I want to get HaKhamim.

c0438
00:23:46.300 --> 00:23:54.300
He says, you are a Sefer Adi, Shaliyah, from Erez Israel. So the Shaliyah ended up going to travel all over the world.

