رَبَّهَمَا كَشَرَتْهَا

c0446
00:24:35.240 --> 00:24:43.020
Alright? The only time that you should abstain or may want to abstain is if you

c0447
00:24:43.020 --> 00:24:50.460
know for sure that this behemah had bu'ah and they made bedikah that according to

c0448
00:24:50.460 --> 00:24:55.140
Marani is not good and according to that, then and then alone you should abstain. So

c0449
00:24:55.140 --> 00:25:00.360
now, here I go to a restaurant, I go to Louis Segal. Yes? Now Louis Segal also is halak.

c0450
00:25:00.360 --> 00:25:05.560
But when I used to come to the religion, it was not halak. I'm eating a steak. My assumption is,

c0451
00:25:05.560 --> 00:25:12.240
ربهم اتك شرطهم, and that's the end of it. Alright? So that's my policy till today.

c0452
00:25:12.240 --> 00:25:18.240
And I also believe that of course, each one, we should have traditions and so on, but we should

c0453
